/F2 15 Tf (Extended abstract answers) Tj T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf (An extended abstract answer goes beyond the information that was given. The student) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (treats the relational explanation as one case of a more general principle and uses the) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (principle in a new situation.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf (For the day and night question, the student might add: "The same reasoning explains why) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (the length of a day is different on other planets and why there are places with a polar) Tj T*
